EESchema Schematic File Version 4
EELAYER 30 0
EELAYER END
$Descr User 42600 29300
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "DC-Modules 50 kW liquid — DC-DC board (full-bridge LLC)"
Date "2026-09-06"
Rev "D.4"
Comp "DC-Modules 50 kW liquid - board DC-DC (upper), sheet 2 of 3"
Comment1 "Module 50 kW liquid = two-board sandwich: sheet 1 AC-DC (lower) + sheet 2 DC-DC (upper), bolted DCP/DCN/PE studs + 40-way control harness"
Comment2 "Content: full-bridge LLC: 2x SG2M023120LJ per position + 470 pF/die turn-off snubber, 11x33 nF + D2 rev F 3.20 uH, 2 cells, film banks 14x2.2 uF, DOUT (E67/E68)"
Comment3 "22 functional sections - 308 components - cross-section links are global net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, CUSTOM = made to drawing)"
$EndDescr
